# CI tool pins for this repo. WITHOUT THIS FILE THE GATE CANNOT RUN AT ALL.
#
# `reusable-10-ci-python.yml` (the workflow `pr-00-gate.yml` calls) refuses to install any tooling
# unless this file exists, and requires an EXACT `==` pin for pytest and pytest-xdist
# unconditionally — plus pytest-cov and coverage when coverage is on, and black/ruff/mypy/isort/
# docformatter when their checks are on. Missing file => `exit 1` in the shared "Install
# dependencies" step, BEFORE any tool runs.
#
# WHY IT WAS MISSING HERE. `pr-00-gate.yml` is synced from stranske/Workflows
# (.github/sync-manifest.yml, `sync_mode: create_only`), but this file is in that manifest's
# EXCLUDED list: "Repo-specific CI version pins; consumers copy or override per
# docs/ci/WORKFLOWS.md. Intentionally not synced". So the sync delivered a Gate that hard-requires
# a file the sync deliberately never delivers, and every Python PR failed all five python-ci jobs
# (lint-ruff, lint-format, typecheck-mypy, python 3.12, python 3.13) at the install step — never
# on a lint finding. The documented consumer procedure is to copy this file:
# stranske/Workflows docs/ci/WORKFLOWS.md line 83.
#
# HOW IT STAYS CORRECT. Nothing updates a consumer's copy automatically: Renovate's fleet preset
# excludes dev tools (they are owned by this file) and `maint-52-sync-dev-versions.yml` propagates
# settled pins into a consumer `pyproject.toml`, which this repo does not have. Re-copy from
# stranske/Workflows/.github/workflows/autofix-versions.env when the fleet bumps.
#
# BUMPING A PIN IS A RE-MEASURE. These versions decide what the Gate's lint/format checks find,
# so docs/CI_LINT_BASELINE.md records the numbers measured against exactly these versions and
# test_ci_gate_config.py asserts the two agree. Change a pin here without re-measuring and the
# suite goes red — that coupling is what stops a silent tool upgrade from widening the rule set
# behind the recorded baseline (ruff 0.16 widened its own default from 79 findings to 915 here).
BLACK_VERSION=26.5.1
RUFF_VERSION=0.16.4
ISORT_VERSION=8.0.1
DOCFORMATTER_VERSION=1.7.8
MYPY_VERSION=2.3.1
PYTEST_VERSION=9.1.1
PYTEST_COV_VERSION=7.1.0
PYTEST_XDIST_VERSION=3.8.0
COVERAGE_VERSION=7.15.4
